ind":"update","title":"Demo Patch","summary":"Hey everyone!A bit of news to go along with this demo patch. There had been up until this point a cryptic greyed out \"conquest\" mode in the UI, and a very brief reference to it in the store page. After quite a bit of deliberation I've reworked and overhauled that game mode, and I'm excited to share the new reworked mode replacing it:Alien SwarmDefend against endless waves of alien enemies, and try to hold your base as long as you can! It's a brand new way to experience the game and the maps, whe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T12:20:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951303044","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3949060-1838407329258295","game_id":"steam-3949060","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch","summary":"Good morning everyone! The demo is now updated with bugfixes and improvements. Change List:Fixed one light gun carriage cost that was inconsistent with othersLight Dual Cannon: reduced damageFixed unit type display in loadout pane to support more unit typesFixed lopsided team starts (1v2, 2v1)Added effect to repair bay while workingExpanded resignation conditions for the AIAI no longer trains bridge builders on maps without bridgesAdded AI difficulties to mid-match player name listAdjusted water","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-17T02:14:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329258295","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3949060-1835871199299442","game_id":"steam-3949060","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch","summary":"Thank you to everyone for the feedback and bug reports!The demo patch is now live and includes a number of important bug fixes as well as a few balance changes and improvements. Change List:Added option to turn off chat messages from opponentsAdded volume settingsAdjusted music volume so background tracks are more audibleNegative handicap now applied to easy and moderate AI difficultiesFixed issue where navigation plane would scan before cliffs spawned, allowing units to move through some cliffs","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-17T03:43:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199299442","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3949060-1833334318575523","game_id":"steam-3949060","kind":"update","title":"Development Update","summary":"Hi everyone! I wanted to share a new feature I've been developing, AI chats! Computer players have the ability to send you various little taunts and messages throughout the game. They range from basic little messages just saying hello to scouting advice or messages asking for help defending their base. It's a feature I really like, and I think it really adds a lot more personality to the AI players you play against while also providing a lot of useful info, especially in team games.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-24T15:33:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318575523","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3949060-1830163047252020","game_id":"steam-3949060","kind":"update","title":"Development Update","summary":"Good Morning Everyone!There's quite a lot going on behind the scenes, but I want to focus on the new reworked loadout selection system. My goal is to streamline the unit selection process and simplify choices by providing more structure to the loadout composition. In the new system in each slot on the left hand side corresponds to a unit series, where you can select from a small set of choices within that series. This is similar to how unit series were defined before, but now each series has its","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-14T22:04:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047252020","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3949060-1821922921814302","game_id":"steam-3949060","kind":"update","title":"Development Update","summary":"Good Afternoon Everyone!Let's go over the three basic types of aircraft. We have fighter planes, attack planes, and gunships. All of them train from an airfield and have some similar mechanics to know about.Shared MechanicsAircraft all have the same basic mechanics. They train from an airfield, and once they run out of ammo they have to return to an airfield to resupply. Airfields also repair damaged aircraft, so players can return them early if needed. FighterThese light aircraft are typically ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-15T20:48:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821922921814302","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3949060-1816307528966534","game_id":"steam-3949060","kind":"update","title":"Development Update","summary":"Good morning everyone! This month I'd like to share with you a little update we've been doing to the terrain. It's a bit of a balancing act between making it aesthetic while keeping it performative, but we're pretty happy with the results so far! Take a look at the old bridge scene side by side with the new one:There's a bit more irregularity to the cliffs, a bit more detail to the ground, and some updated water. When put together it breaks up the solid lines and adds a bit of that 3D effect to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-15T14:54:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816307528966534","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3949060-1811772772547703","game_id":"steam-3949060","kind":"update","title":"Development Update","summary":"Good morning everyone!There's been quite a bit of work done since the page was announced. I've added some quality of life features, updated parts of the UI, and improved the functionality of the loadout selection page. Most importantly, though, I've been working on a tutorial/playtest mission to help validate and polish core systems:So far the map consists of a series of attack waves, as well as a couple objectives to take before you can achieve victory. I've also been focused on making the batt","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-04T17:12:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772547703","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3949060":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:20:45Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:20:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3949060":"2026-10-26T11:20:45Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3949060":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:20:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:20:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:20:45Z"},"4803090":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:20:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:20:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:20:45Z"}},"contex